📝 Advanced To-Do List

A modern and responsive To-Do List web application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. This project helps users organize and manage their daily tasks efficiently.

🚀 Features
➕ Add new tasks
✏️ Edit existing tasks
🗑️ Delete tasks
✅ Mark tasks as completed
🔍 Search tasks
📂 Filter tasks by category/status
⭐ Set task priority
📊 Task counter
💾 Local Storage support
📱 Responsive design
✨ Smooth CSS animations and effects
🛠️ Technologies Used
HTML5 – Website structure
CSS3 – Styling, animations, and responsive design
JavaScript – Functionality and task management
Local Storage – Saving tasks in the browser
📂 Project Structure
advanced-todo-list/
│
├── First task.html
├── style.css
├── todolist.js
└── README.md
▶️ How to Run
Download or clone this repository.
Open First task.html in your browser.
Start adding and managing your tasks.
🎯 Purpose

This project was created to practice and demonstrate frontend web development skills, especially JavaScript DOM manipulation, event handling, Local Storage, and responsive UI design.
